{"id":51593,"date":"2026-06-05T07:37:21","date_gmt":"2026-06-05T06:37:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51593"},"modified":"2026-09-02T20:30:59","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T19:30:59","slug":"corrida-100-anos-ordem-dos-advogados","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-100-anos-ordem-dos-advogados\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida 100 anos Ordem dos Advogados 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida 100 anos Ordem dos Advogados 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Corrida 100 anos Ordem dos Advogados 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>20 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, no ic\u00f3nico <strong>Parque Florestal de Monsanto<\/strong>, em <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Promovida pela <strong>Ordem dos Advogados<\/strong> com organiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>Xistarca<\/strong>, a prova comemora o Centen\u00e1rio da institui\u00e7\u00e3o num grande encontro desportivo e de conv\u00edvio aberto a advogados, juristas, agentes do setor da justi\u00e7a, fam\u00edlias e todos os praticantes da modalidade.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o e partida no <strong>Anfiteatro Keil do Amaral<\/strong>, o programa arranca \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> com a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> e a emocionante <strong>Estafeta 5+5 km<\/strong> (duplas), seguindo-se \u00e0s 09:35 a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong>. O percurso desenvolve-se no cora\u00e7\u00e3o verde da capital e inclui t-shirt comemorativa oficial do evento, dorsal personalizado com chip, abastecimentos e medalha de finalista para todos os participantes.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-te